{"ref":"BDB, חַטָּא","hw":"חַטָּא","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּא</span>]</big>  <strong>adj.</strong> and <strong>n.m. 1. sinful</strong>, <strong>2. sinners</strong>—as adj.f. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּאָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:8\" href=\"/Amos.9.8\">Am 9:8</a>, elsewhere only pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:14\" href=\"/Numbers.32.14\">Nu 32:14</a> + 15 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:10\" href=\"/Amos.9.10\">Am 9:10</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּאֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.9\">Is 13:9</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>adj.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>sinful</em> men <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:14\" href=\"/Numbers.32.14\">Nu 32:14</a> (J), kingdom <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:8\" href=\"/Amos.9.8\">Am 9:8</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>exposed to condemnation, reckoned as offenders</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.21\">1 K 1:21</a> (cf. Hiph. Pt. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.21\">Is 29:21</a>). Elsewhere<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <em>sinners</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:3\" href=\"/Numbers.17.3\">Nu 17:3</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.18\">1 S 15:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:10\" href=\"/Amos.9.10\">Am 9:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.28\">Is 1:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.9\">13:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.14\">33:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:1\" href=\"/Psalms.1.1\">ψ 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:5\" href=\"/Psalms.1.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:8\" href=\"/Psalms.25.8\">25:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:9\" href=\"/Psalms.26.9\">26:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:15\" href=\"/Psalms.51.15\">51:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:35\" href=\"/Psalms.104.35\">104:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.10\">Pr 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.21\">13:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.17\">23:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ ליהוה</span> <em>sinners against</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:13\" href=\"/Genesis.13.13\">Gn 13:13</a> (J).","next":"BDB, חַטָּאָה","prev":"BDB, חֵטְא"}